OL,3,GNEWSAIndie and punk music made me feel
OL,4,AI was betraying my race
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrowing up in Wolverhampton, Stephanie
OL,7,FPhillips says she was initially pretty
OL,8,Fmuch into the same chart music as her
OL,9,Ffriends.
OL,11,FBut alongside TLC, Aaliyah and
OL,12,FDestiny's Child, she developed a
OL,13,Fpassion for rock, indie and punk.
OL,15,F"It was music that meant a lot to me as
OL,16,Fsomeone who was very shy and needed an
OL,17,Foutlet," she said. Yet she felt
OL,18,Fcompelled to keep that passion hidden.
